      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-08T21:15:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it will eventually run as part of CQ, so more generous timeout \u003d\u003d better. I think we should just reuse the timeout, and drop it down if it proves to be too much.",
